%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dataweave-formats-ndjson (言語ガイド)
doc と相違 (表記のみ: 引用符・括弧・書式の違いで、値は同じ)
doc の Output:
  [
      {"name": "Leandro","lastName": "Shokida"},
      {"name": "Mariano","lastName": "De Achaval"}
  ]
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/dw
---
payload
%%% input payload application/x-ndjson
{"name": "Leandro","lastName": "Shokida"}
{"name": "Mariano","lastName": "De Achaval"}
%%% output application/dw
[
  {
    name: "Leandro",
    lastName: "Shokida"
  }, 
  {
    name: "Mariano",
    lastName: "De Achaval"
  }
] as Array {encoding: "UTF-8", mediaType: "application/x-ndjson"}
